		{
			description: [
				"Certain actions such as killing animals, villagers, or babies will gain you points in a particular stat: naughtiness. Reaching certain values, you will hear the laugh of Krampus."
				"Naughtiness can be reduced through \"good\" actions such as using bonemeal on plants or taming animals."
				"The evilometer lets you track your naughtiness"
